net SCS1 N12.5 P13.5
net SRC1 N12.13 P11.2
net SRC5 N12.14 N11.2
net STC1 N12.15 P16.2 N15.3 BOARD
net STC4 P12.2 P15.3 N15.11 BOARD
net SLC0 P12.3 M11.3
net SLC4 P12.4 L11.3
net SCS0 P12.5 P13.3 P13.11
net SRC0 P12.13 P11.3
net SRC4 P12.14 N11.3
net STC0 P12.15 P16.3 N15.2 BOARD
net SPCA P14.6 P13.10 P14.10 M15.9
